Rename this file to your tool name.
Support --autoextract-describe and print:
{"name":"myformat","extensions":[".myformat"],"priority":50}
Support --autoextract-extract SOURCE DESTINATION.
For progress, print AUSO_PROGRESS 42 for percent,
or AUSO_PROGRESS 123456 456789 for done/total bytes.
If the EXE cannot do that, add tool.progress.py beside tool.exe.
Exit 0 for success.
